[0.005, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI'm\u001b[7Greading\u001b[15GManifest's\u001b[26Gplans\u001b[32Gfor\u001b[36GW13.\u001b[41GIt\u001b[44Gisn't\u001b[50Gplanned\u001b[58Gyet,\u001b[63Gso\u001b[66GI'm\u001b[70Gworking\u001b[78Gout\u001b[82Gwhich\u001b[88Gdesign\u001b[95Gchoices\u001b[103Git\u001b[106Gneeds\u001b[112Gbefore\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gany code.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m8\u001b[22m patterns, read \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m files \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m W13 isn't planned in Manifest yet, so a few rules need settling first. The engine looks untouched, since regions,\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  organisations, projects and tenders\u001b[39Gfrom\u001b[44GW04\u001b[48Gand\u001b[52GW12\u001b[56Galready\u001b[64Gcover\u001b[70Git.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\r\u001b[1B────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B← \u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Eligibility \u001b[39m\u001b[49m ☐ Price goes to  ☐ Cancel policy  ☐ Views  ✔ Submit  →\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mFounding a homeworld: which regions can a player found in, and how many?\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m❯\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m1.\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mUngoverned, one each (Recommended)\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mA principal\u001b[18Gfounds one homeworld, only in a region no one governs (as governance.yaml's Forge North/South). Buying \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1BAI neighbours stays L03.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m2.\u001b[39m Ungoverned or AI,\u001b[24Gone each\u001b[33G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mFounding may also buy out an AI-governed neighbour (D-015's purchasable AI \u001b[82Gegions), one per principal.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3.\u001b[6G\u001b[39mUngoverned,\u001b[18Gno\u001b[21Glimit\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mAny number of\u001b[20Gungoverned regions, bounded only by price.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4. Type something.\r\u001b[1B────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  5.\u001b[6GChat\u001b[11Gabout\u001b[17Gthis\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mEnter to select · Tab/Arrow keys to navigate · Esc to cancel\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0021 ─\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[15;1H"]
