[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(~/projects/ma\u001b[25Gfest/docs/s\u001b[37Gssion-handoff.md)\u001b[55G\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded\u001b[12G\u001b[1m1\u001b[14G\u001b[22mline,\u001b[20Gremoved\u001b[28G\u001b[1m1\u001b[30G\u001b[22mline\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m  5 \u001b[22m W12 is done: [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mcompetitive procurement\u001b[39m](stage-4-trading-plan.md#tender-contract-w11-2026-11-21),\u001b[107Gon\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m  6 \u001b[22m [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mD-101\u001b[39m](decision-ledger.md#d-101),\u001b[46Gwith\u001b[51Gno\u001b[54Gengine\u001b[61Gedit;\u001b[67Gits\u001b[71Gsix\u001b[75Gslices,\u001b[83Gthe\u001b[87Ggovernance\u001b[98Gfixture\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m7\u001b[11G\u001b[22m(`fixture_governance`) last, and what i\u001b[51G left are in the plan. W13, the multi-region governance\u001b[107G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m  8 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mscenario, is next. The planning documents' home-region allocation (scope, the roadmap's region supply  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m  8 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mscenario, is next, its contract settled ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mD-110\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](decision-ledger.md#d-110), [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mplan\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](stage-4-trading-plan\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m    +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m.md#regional-governance-w13-2026-11-23)) and slice 2, founding, to build. The planning documents' home-\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m \u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mregion allocation (scope, \u001b[38Ghe roadmap's\u001b[51Gregion supply                                                  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m  9 \u001b[22m and D-076) waits for W13 to restate it as founding. W22, the drives past the torch, waits for the first\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 10 \u001b[22m larger hull. Jettison's station traffic lanes were measured and parked (`fixture_traffic`,\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m11\u001b[11G\u001b[22m2026-11-22), to be taken\u001b[36Gup\u001b[39Gwhen it\u001b[47Gfail\u001b[52G. The SDK is pinned\u001b[72Gto `14fc23a`. A\u001b[88Gc\u001b[90Gmmit\u001b[95Gis gated in the\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mListed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m directory, ran \u001b[1m5\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mSlice 1, the plan, is committed in Manifest as\u001b[50G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m9359fb9\u001b[39m.\u001b[59GNow\u001b[63Gslice\u001b[69G2,\u001b[72Gfounding:\u001b[82GI'm\u001b[86Greading\u001b[94Ghow\u001b[98GProcurement's\u001b[112Gcommands\r\u001b[1B  are registered so I can follow the same pattern.\r\u001b[43C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mought for 4s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
