[0.103, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H     \u001b[2m  6 \u001b[22m [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mD-101\u001b[39m](decision-ledger.md#d-101),\u001b[46Gwith\u001b[51Gno\u001b[54Gengine\u001b[61Gedit;\u001b[67Gits\u001b[71Gsix\u001b[75Gslices,\u001b[83Gthe\u001b[87Ggovernance\u001b[98Gfixture\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m7\u001b[11G\u001b[22m(`fixture_governance`) last, and what i\u001b[51G left are in the plan. W13, the multi-region governance\u001b[107G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m  8 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mscenario, is next. The planning documents' home-region allocation (scope, the roadmap's region supply  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m  8 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mscenario, is next, its contract settled ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mD-110\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](decision-ledger.md#d-110), [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mplan\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](stage-4-trading-plan\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m    +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m.md#regional-governance-w13-2026-11-23)) and slice 2, founding, to build. The planning documents' home-\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m \u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mregion allocation (scope, \u001b[38Ghe roadmap's\u001b[51Gregion supply                                                  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m  9 \u001b[22m and D-076) waits for W13 to restate it as founding. W22, the drives past the torch, waits for the first\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 10 \u001b[22m larger hull. Jettison's station traffic lanes were measured and parked (`fixture_traffic`,\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m11\u001b[11G\u001b[22m2026-11-22), to be taken\u001b[36Gup\u001b[39Gwhen it\u001b[47Gfail\u001b[52G. The SDK is pinned\u001b[72Gto `14fc23a`. A\u001b[88Gc\u001b[90Gmmit\u001b[95Gis gated in the\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mListed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m directory, ran \u001b[1m5\u001b[22m shell commands \u0