[0.119, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m 1763 \u001b[16G\u001b[22mgovernance\u001b[27Gworld\u001b[33G(`0xa8a6a8164aad2192`)\u001b[56Gand\u001b[60G`fixture_governance`\u001b[81G(`0xda825a474fa85952`).\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 1764 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m4. Unattended development: `\u001b[48;2;92;2;0mSetPolicy\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m`, the issuer for a player's region within its limit, the       \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 1765 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   reason kept.                                                                                      \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 1764 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m4. Unattended development: `\u001b[48;2;4;71;0mSetDevelopment\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m`, the issuer for a player's region within its limit, the  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 1765 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   reason kept. **Done** 2026-11-23, with no engine edit: the limit bounds the budgets of the region'\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m      +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242ms                                                                                                    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 1766 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   live tenders, open and awarded, the one to be issued's included; a set clears the wait. The       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 1767 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   procurement suite has Forge West's policy wait past its limit and on an empty treasury, then      \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m1768 +\u001b[14G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  tender the guild's copper at a turn's end on the AI's windows,\u001b[79Gand\u001b[83Gstop\u001b[88Gwhen\u001b[93Gturned\u001b[100Goff.\u001b[105GFour\u001b[110Gpins\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 1769 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   moved for the save's new component storage alone, every other check of theirs unchanged: the      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 1770 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   company suite's governance world (`0x38e37debf6c681a2`), the trading fixture's loop               \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 1771 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   (`0xf6bc2a278ee8d60c`), `fixture_alone` (`0x07ca71f6577f7997`) and `fixture_governance`           \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 1772 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m   (`0x9e18495904a24038`).                                                                           \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[2m 1773 \u001b[22m 5. The region\u001b[27Gview\u001b[32Gin\u001b[35Gthe\u001b[39Gsnapshot.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 1774 \u001b[13G\u001b[22m6.\u001b[16G`fixture_development`,\u001b[39Gthen\u001b[44Gthe\u001b[48Gclose-out.\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 1775 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BSearching for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m patt\u001b[24Grn,\u001b[28Grunning \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands…\u001b[K\r\u001b[16C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m30m 56s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m78.5k tokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[6B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
