[0.051, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5Gproject\u001b[13Gcancell\u001b[21Gd while still tendering keeps what was delivered for a\u001b[76Glater requeue.\u001b[91GI\u001b[93Gadded\u001b[99Ga\u001b[101Gsecond\u001b[108Gproject,\u001b[117Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gsmelters' guild, which teache\u001b[36Gsmelting so a regio\u001b[57Glacking the\u001b[69Gskill can queue it ahead of Bronze.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe standing policy:\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mManifest.Procurement.SetDevelopment\u001b[39m \u001b[63Gets the AI\u001b[74Gissuer tender the hea\u001b[96G project's inputs for a\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bplayer'\u001b[13G reg\u001b[18Gon\u001b[23Githin a sp\u001b[34Gnding l\u001b[42Gmit and\u001b[50Gfrom the treasury alone.\u001b[75GWhen it holds back, it \u001b[99Gecords\u001b[106Gwhy\u001b[110G(over\u001b[116Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Glimit, or no funds).\u001b[26G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe region view:\u001b[22G\u001b[22mevery player sees\u001b[40Gevery\u001b[46Gregion and its gove\u001b[66Gnor. The\u001b[75Gtr\u001b[78Gasury, queue and\u001b[95Gpolicy are\u001b[106Gs\u001b[108Gown only to\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bits gove\u001b[14Gnor\u001b[18Gand the\u001b[26Ghost.\u001b[32GThe\u001b[36Gview\u001b[41Galso\u001b[46Ggoes\u001b[51Gto\u001b[54Gnetwork\u001b[62Gclients,\u001b[71Gso\u001b[74Ga\u001b[76Greconnecting\u001b[89Gclient\u001b[96Ggets\u001b[101Git.\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[1macceptanc\u001b[19G fixture, \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfixture_development\u001b[39m:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- Ada fou\u001b[15Gds\u001b[18GForge North. With\u001b[36Gno client\u001b[46Gc\u001b[48Gnnected, he\u001b[60G ship's job supplies the guild and Bronze, and\u001b[107Gboth\u001b[112Gfinish\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G  within about fifteen simulated days.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BHer\u001b[11Gj\u001b[13Gb also supplied Forge East's Bronze, which its AI worked on its own.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B-\u001b[7GBea joins late and founds Forge South;\u001b[46GCara\u001b[51Gis\u001b[54Grefused\u001b[62Gin\u001b[65Gevery\u001b[71Gregion.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BLoading\u001b[16G mid-run save and replaying from the star\u001b[58G both reach\u001b[70Gthe same pinned\u001b[86Gworld.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mPinned hashes moved, by save layout or content only:\u001b[22m every oth\u001b[66Gr check\u001b[74Gin those tests still\u001b[95Gpasses.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GThe\u001b[9Gqueue's\u001b[17Gnew\u001b[21Gsaved\u001b[27Gfield\u001b[33Gmoved\u001b[39G2\u001b[41Gpins.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- The policy's component storage moved 4, because a sa\u001b[59G lis\u001b[64Gs it even\u001b[74Gwhen empty.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BForge North's new workshop moved 2.\u001b[41G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mStill to do, recorded in the plan:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
