249m/compact\u001b[105G\u001b[39mor\u001b[108Gstart\u001b[114Ga\u001b[116Gnew\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsessi\u001b[9Gn before W14.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GBrewed for 1h 26m 1s · done 8:56 pm\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m※\u001b[3G\u001b[1mrecap: \u001b[22m\u001b[3mW13, Manifest's regional governance (founding a homeworld, project queues, a governor's standing policy, the \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bregion view), is done, and its gate passed; nothing is pushed. Next is W14, closing Stage 4, ideally after a \r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\u001b[3m`/compact` or a fresh session. (turn off recaps in /config)\u001b[23m\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
