[2.083, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G \u001b[5Gits\u001b[9Gg\u001b[11Gvernor\u001b[18Gand th\u001b[25G ho\u001b[30G. Th\u001b[36Gview also goes to network clien\u001b[68Gs, so\u001b[74Ga reconnecting\u001b[89Gclient\u001b[96Ggets\u001b[101Git.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThe acceptance fixture, \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfixture_development\u001b[39m:\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m-\u001b[7GAda\u001b[11Gfounds\u001b[18GForge\u001b[24GNorth.\u001b[31GWith\u001b[36Gno\u001b[39Gclient\u001b[46Gconnected,\u001b[57Gher\u001b[61Gship's\u001b[68Gjob\u001b[72Gsupplies\u001b[81Gthe\u001b[85Gguild\u001b[91Gand\u001b[95GBronze,\u001b[103Gand\u001b[107Gboth\u001b[112Gfinish\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B    within about fifteen simulated\u001b[38Gdays.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G- Her job also supplie\u001b[28G Forge East's Bronze, which its AI worked\u001b[70Gon\u001b[73Gits\u001b[77Gown.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G- Bea\u001b[11Gj\u001b[13Gins late and founds Forge South; C\u001b[48Gra is\u001b[54Gr\u001b[56Gfus\u001b[60Gd in every region.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G- Loading a mid-run save and\u001b[34Greplaying from the start\u001b[59Gboth\u001b[64Greach\u001b[70Gthe\u001b[74Gsame\u001b[79Gpinned\u001b[86Gworld.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mPinned hashes moved, by save layout or content only:\u001b[56G\u001b[22mevery\u001b[62Gother\u001b[68Gcheck\u001b[74Gin\u001b[77Gthose\u001b[83Gtests\u001b[89Gstill\u001b[95Gpasses.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GThe\u001b[9Gqueue's\u001b[17Gnew\u001b[21Gsaved\u001b[27Gfield\u001b[33Gmoved\u001b[39G2\u001b[41Gpins.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- The policy's comp\u001b[23Gnent storage moved 4, bec\u001b[49Guse a save lists it eve\u001b[73G when\u001b[79Gempty.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- Forge North's new workshop moved 2.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[1mStill to do, recorded in the plan:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- Console and TUI commands\u001b[30Gfor\u001b[34Gfounding,\u001b[44Gthe\u001b[48Gqueue\u00