s roadmap and history are updated\u001b[46G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m69e0963\u001b[39m).\u001b[57GNo\u001b[60Gcross-review\u001b[73Gyet:\u001b[78Gthat\u001b[83Gcomes\u001b[89Gwhen\u001b[94GW14\u001b[98Gcloses\u001b[105Gthe\u001b[109Gstage.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BUnder ASan the new fixture takes 352\u001b[40Gs,\u001b[43Gwhich\u001b[49Glengthens\u001b[59Gthe\u001b[63Ggate.\u001b[69GThis\u001b[74Gis\u001b[77Ga\u001b[79Gnatural\u001b[87Gpoint\u001b[93Gto\u001b[96G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/compact\u001b[105G\u001b[39mor\u001b[108Gstart\u001b[114Ga\u001b[116Gnew\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsession before W14.       \u001b[30G   \u001b[34G         \u001b[44G   \u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[4.102, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H  - The policy's component storage moved 4, because a save lists it even when empty.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GForge\u001b[11GN\u001b[13Grth's n\u001b[21Gw workshop moved 2.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mStill to do, recorded in the plan:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- Console and TUI commands for founding, the queue and the\u001b[62Gpolicy.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mFound\u001b[39m do\u001b[14Gsn't check the regional plan's station,\u001b[54Gdelivery\u001b[63Gand\u001b[67Glife-support\u001b[80Gconditions\u001b[91Gfor\u001b[95Ga\u001b[97Ghomeworld.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BReorder\u001b[13Gng a\u001b[18Gqueue (for n\u001b[31Gw, cancel and\u001b[45Gqueue ag\u001b[54Gin).\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BReli\u001b[10Gf tenders under a player's policy.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GAI\u001b[8Gacquisition\u001b[20G(L03)\u001b[26Gand\u001b[30Gregion\u001b[37Gsupply\u001b[44G(D-076).\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe home-region all\u001b[23Gcation\u001b[30Gin \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mscope.md\u001b[39m, the Manif\u001b[53Gst roadma\u001b[63G, D-076\u001b[71Gand\u001b[75Gthe\u001b[79Gregional\u001b[88Gplan\u001b[93Gnow\u001b[97Greads\u001b[103Gas\u001b[106Gfounding.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BJettison's roadmap and \u001b[27Gistory are\u001b[38Gupdated (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m69e0963\u001b[39m). No cross-revi\u001b[71Gw yet: \u001b[79Ghat comes when W14 closes the\u001b[109Gstage.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BUnd\u001b[7Gr ASan th\u001b[17G new fixture takes 352 s, which\u001b[49Glengthens\u001b[59Gthe\u001b[63Ggate.\u001b[69GThis\u001b[74Gis\u001b[77Ga\u001b[79Gnatural\u001b[87Gpoint\u001b[93Gto\u001b[96G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/compact\u001b[105G\u001b[39mor\u001b[108Gstart\u001b[114Ga\u001b[116Gnew\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsession before W14.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GBrewed for 1h 26m 1s · done 8:56 pm\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u