[0.006, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5GAI acquisition (L03) and\u001b[30Gregion supply\u001b[44G(D-076).\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe hom\u001b[11G-re\u001b[15Gion allocation in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mscope.md\u001b[39m, the Manifest roadmap,\u001b[65GD-076\u001b[71Gand\u001b[75Gthe\u001b[79Gregional\u001b[88Gplan\u001b[93Gnow\u001b[97Greads\u001b[103Gas\u001b[106Gfounding.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BJettison's roadmap and\u001b[26Ghistory are updated\u001b[46G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m69e0963\u001b[39m).\u001b[57GNo\u001b[60Gcross-review\u001b[73Gyet:\u001b[78Gthat\u001b[83Gcomes\u001b[89Gwhen\u001b[94GW14\u001b[98Gcloses\u001b[105Gthe\u001b[109Gstage.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BUnder\u001b[9GASan\u001b[14Gthe\u001b[18Gnew\u001b[22Gfixture\u001b[30Gtakes\u001b[36G352\u001b[40Gs,\u001b[43Gwhich\u001b[49Glengthens\u001b[59Gthe\u001b[63Ggate.\u001b[69GThis\u001b[74Gis\u001b[77Ga\u001b[79Gnatural\u001b[87Gpoint\u001b[93Gto\u001b[96G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/compact\u001b[105G\u001b[39mor\u001b[108Gstart\u001b[114Ga\u001b[116Gnew\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsessi\u001b[9Gn before W14.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GBrewed for 1h 26m 1s · done 8:56 pm\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m※\u001b[3G\u001b[1mrecap: \u001b[22m\u001b[3mW13, Manifest's regional governance (founding a homeworld, project queues, a governor's standing policy, the \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bregion view), is done, and its gate passed; nothing is pushed. Next is W14, closing Stage 4, ideally after a \r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\u001b[3m`/compact` or a fresh session. (turn off recaps in /config)\r\u001b[2B\u001b[23m\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m❯\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m/compact\u001b[39m                                                                                                              \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[