the\u001b[106Glot\u001b[110Gsold\u001b[115Gon\u001b[118Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bold\u001b[7Gcode too. Only the sanitised build would hav\u001b[52G stopped on it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThe review's five new blockers.\u001b[35G\u001b[22mEach\u001b[40Gcomes\u001b[46Gwith\u001b[51Ga\u001b[53Greproduction\u001b[66Gunder\u001b[72G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mbuild/reviews/stage-4/scratch\u001b[39m:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1. \u001b[1mRefuelling:\u001b[22m it buys whole totes, but the trip estimate assumes the tanks fill completely. A heavy\u001b[104Gship\u001b[109Gkeeps\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gchoosing a burn it can't fly and\u001b[39Gstays blocked, \u001b[55Ghough\u001b[62G \u001b[64Glower burn would work.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mFee schedule:\u001b[22m a\u001b[22Gsave wi\u001b[30Gh an\u001b[35Gempty fee\u001b[45Gschedule\u001b[54Gloads,\u001b[61Gthen crashes the first time\u001b[89Ga\u001b[91Gship\u001b[96Gtravels.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3\u001b[6G\u001b[1mTax\u001b[10Gcarry:\u001b[22m a s\u001b[21Gved wage-tax carry o\u001b[42G any size loads, and the next payroll throws.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4\u001b[6G\u001b[1mOpened totes:\u001b[22m \u001b[21G saved opened tote\u001b[40Gcan hol\u001b[77Gn kilograms\u001b[89Gof\u001b[92Goxygen\u001b[99Gin\u001b[102Gone\u001b[106Gtote.\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
