[0.198, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[7Ghrinks. Codex confirmed the drop in th\u001b[46G pinned \u001b[56Ggine, but couldn't run\u001b[79Ga real connection because its sandbox\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Br\u001b[8Gfused a local socket.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mRefuelling eats a pellet cargo without telling the job\u001b[22m (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mCompany.cpp:579\u001b[39m).\u001b[80GWhen\u001b[85Ga\u001b[87Gship\u001b[92Grefuels\u001b[100Gits\u001b[104Gfusion-pellet\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gmagazine from pellets it is carrying to sell, the trade job still counts th\u001b[82G original tote\u001b[97G. On arrival it tri\u001b[117Gs to\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bunload more than\u001b[23Gare left, g\u001b[35Gts \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mInsufficientStock\u001b[39m,\u001b[57Gand blocks.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mAutomatic bidders ignore the delivery deadline\u001b[22m (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mPolicy.cpp:905\u001b[39m). A job bids on a tend\u001b[92Gr without\u001b[102Gc\u001b[105Gcking that\u001b[116Gthe\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Btrip fits th\u001b[19G delive\u001b[27Gy window. Codex's job bid on a route estimated at 7.6\u001b[81Gdays\u001b[86Gagains\u001b[93G a 1-day window, won,\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bd\u001b[8Gliv\u001b[12Gred\u001b[16Gn\u001b[18Gthing and lost\u001b[33Gits\u001b[37Gbond.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BNothing \u001b[12Gs fixed\u001b[20Gor commit\u001b[30Ged yet; the tree is unc\u001b[54Ganged.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mDecisi\u001b[10Gn for\u001b[16Gyou:\u001b[22m how to fix finding 2. Options:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mSplit the snapshot across messages in Jettison's network layer:\u001b[22m \u001b[70Gn engine change, reusable\u001b[96Gby \u001b[100Gny game, which\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BManifest then p\u001b[21Gcks up\u001b[28Gby moving its pin.\u001b[47GThis\u001b[52Gis\u001b[55Gwhat\u001b[60GI'd\u001b[64Gdo.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u00