[1.759, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bqueue, full pads and mid-cruise saves held.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mRemote snapshots drop fields\u001b[35G\u001b[22m(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mProtocol.cpp\u001b[39m).\u001b[51GThe\u001b[55Gnetwork\u001b[63Gformat\u001b[70Gdoesn't\u001b[78Glist\u001b[83Ga\u001b[85Gship's\u001b[92Gpolicy\u001b[99Gand\u001b[103Gjob,\u001b[108Ga\u001b[110Gcompany's\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gsealed bids, or the posted tenders. A remote\u001b[51Gclie\u001b[56Gt there\u001b[66Ge never sees \u001b[80Gts\u001b[83Gown automation,\u001b[99Gits\u001b[103Gbids\u001b[108Gor the public\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bt\u001b[8Gnd\u001b[11Grs. Codex's round \u001b[30Grip of a real\u001b[44Ggovernance snapshot went from\u001b[74G2 tenders to\u001b[87G0, 1 bid to\u001b[99G0, and policy and job\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bo absent. The fix is to register the\u001b[44Gmissi\u001b[50Gg fields; small.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mSnapshots outgrow the network's packet limit\u001b[22m (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mServer.cpp:227\u001b[39m).\u001b[69GThe\u001b[73Gserver\u001b[80Gsends\u001b[86Gthe\u001b[90Gwhole\u001b[96Gsnapshot\u001b[105Gas\u001b[108Gone\u001b[112Gpacket,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gwhich Jettison's network layer caps at 64 KiB. The trading scenario is already 63,567 byte\u001b[97G, and \u001b[104Gen ordinary\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bresting orders push it past the cap. Jettison then\u001b[57Gd\u001b[59Gops it, so the\u001b[74Gclient's view freezes until th\u001b[105G snapshot\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bshrinks. Codex\u001b[21Gconfirmed the drop in\u001b[43Gthe pin\u001b[51Ged \u001b[56Ggine, bu\u001b[65G couldn't run a real conn\u001b[91Gction because its sandbox\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Brefused a local socket.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mRefuelling eats a pellet cargo without telling the job\u001b[61G\u001b[22m(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mCompany.cpp:579\u001b[39m).\u0