[5.713, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bt\u001b[8Gnd\u001b[11Grs. Codex's round \u001b[30Grip of a real\u001b[44Ggovernance snapshot went from\u001b[74G2 tenders to\u001b[87G0, 1 bid to\u001b[99G0, and policy and job\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bo absent. The fix is to register the\u001b[44Gmissi\u001b[50Gg fields; small.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mSnapshots outgrow the network's packet limit\u001b[22m (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mServer.cpp:227\u001b[39m).\u001b[69GThe\u001b[73Gserver\u001b[80Gsends\u001b[86Gthe\u001b[90Gwhole\u001b[96Gsnapshot\u001b[105Gas\u001b[108Gone\u001b[112Gpacket,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gwhich Jettison's network layer caps at 64 KiB. The trading scenario is already 63,567 byte\u001b[97G, and \u001b[104Gen ordinary\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bresting orders push it past the cap. Jettison then\u001b[57Gd\u001b[59Gops it, so the\u001b[74Gclient's view freezes until th\u001b[105G snapshot\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bshrinks. Codex\u001b[21Gconfirmed the drop in\u001b[43Gthe pin\u001b[51Ged \u001b[56Ggine, bu\u001b[65G couldn't run a real conn\u001b[91Gction because its sandbox\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Brefused a local socket.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mRefuelling eats a pellet cargo without telling the job\u001b[61G\u001b[22m(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mCompany.cpp:579\u001b[39m).\u001b[80GWhen\u001b[85Ga\u001b[87Gship\u001b[92Grefuels\u001b[100Gits\u001b[104Gfusion-pellet\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gmagazine from pellets it is carrying to sell, the trade job still counts the original\u001b[92Gtotes. On arrival it tries\u001b[119Gto\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bunload more than are left, gets \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mInsufficientStock\u001b[39m, an\u001b[60G bl\u001b[64Gck\u001b[67G.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mAutomatic bidders ignore the delivery deadline\u001b[22m (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mPolicy.cpp:905\u001b[39m).\u001b[71GA\u001b[73Gjob\u001b[77Gbids\u001b[82Gon\u001b[85Ga\u001b[87Gtender\u001b[94Gwithout\u001b[102Gchecking\u001b[111Gthat\u001b[116Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gtrip fits the delivery window. Codex's job bid\u001b[53Gon a route estimated at\u001b[77G7.6 days against\u001b[94Ga 1-day\u001b[102Gwindow, won,\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bdelivered\u001b[16Gnothing and lost its\u001b[37Gb\u001b[39Gnd.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BNothing\u001b[11Gis\u001b[14Gfixed\u001b[20Gor\u001b[23Gcommitted\u001b[33Gyet;\u001b[38Gthe\u001b[42Gtree\u001b[47Gis\u001b[50Gunchanged.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mDecision for you:\u001b[21G\u001b[22mhow\u001b[25Gto\u001b[28Gfix\u001b[32Gfinding\u001b[40G2.\u001b[43GOptions:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mSpl\u001b[9Gt the snapshot across messages in Jettison's network layer:\u001b[69G\u001b[22man\u001b[72Gengine\u001b[79Gchange,\u001b[87Greusable\u001b[96Gby\u001b[99Gany\u001b[103Ggame,\u001b[109Gwhich\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5GManifest then picks up by moving its pin. This is what I'd do.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mSmaller snapshots in Manifest:\u001b[22m send only w\u001b[76Ge.\u001b[79GThat\u001b[84Gstays\u001b[90Gin\u001b[93GManifest\u001b[102Gbut\u001b[106Gis\u001b[109Ga\u001b[111Gbigger\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
