[0.166, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6Grefused a local socket.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mRefuelling eats a pellet cargo without telling the job\u001b[61G\u001b[22m(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mCompany.cpp:579\u001b[39m).\u001b[80GWhen\u001b[85Ga\u001b[87Gship\u001b[92Grefuels\u001b[100Gits\u001b[104Gfusion-pellet\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gmagazine from pellets it is carrying to sell, the trade job still counts the original\u001b[92Gtotes. On arrival it tries\u001b[119Gto\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bunload more than are left, gets \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mInsufficientStock\u001b[39m, an\u001b[60G bl\u001b[64Gck\u001b[67G.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mAutomatic bidders ignore the delivery deadline\u001b[22m (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mPolicy.cpp:905\u001b[39m).\u001b[71GA\u001b[73Gjob\u001b[77Gbids\u001b[82Gon\u001b[85Ga\u001b[87Gtender\u001b[94Gwithout\u001b[102Gchecking\u001b[111Gthat\u001b[116Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gtrip fits the delivery window. Codex's job bid\u001b[53Gon a route estimated at\u001b[77G7.6 days against\u001b[94Ga 1-day\u001b[102Gwindow, won,\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bdelivered\u001b[16Gnothing and lost its\u001b[37Gb\u001b[39Gnd.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BNothing\u001b[11Gis\u001b[14Gfixed\u001b[20Gor\u001b[23Gcommitted\u001b[33Gyet;\u001b[38Gthe\u001b[42Gtree\u001b[47Gis\u001b[50Gunchanged.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mDecision for you:\u001b[21G\u001b[22mhow\u001b[25Gto\u001b[28Gfix\u001b[32Gfinding\u001b[40G2.\u001b[43GOptions:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mSpl\u001b[9Gt the snapshot across messages in Jettison's network layer:\u001b[69G\u001b[22man\u001b[72Gengine\u001b[79Gchange,\u001b[87Greusable\u001b[96Gby\u001b[99Gany\u001b[103Ggame,\u001b[109Gwhich\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5GManifest then picks up by moving its pin. This is what I'd do.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mSmaller snapshots in Manifest:\u001b[22m send only what changed since the\u001b[69Glast\u001b[74Gone.\u001b[79GThat\u001b[84Gstays\u001b[90Gin\u001b[93GManifest\u001b[102Gbut\u001b[106Gis\u001b[109Ga\u001b[111Gbigger\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gprotocol change.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mRaise the packet limit:\u001b[29G\u001b[22monly\u001b[34Gbuys\u001b[39Gtime.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BFindings\u001b[12G1,\u001b[15G3\u001b[17Gand\u001b[21G4\u001b[23Gare\u001b[27Gclear\u001b[33Gfixes\u001b[39GI\u001b[41Gcan\u001b[45Gmake\u001b[50Gnow,\u001b[55Gwith\u001b[60Gtests\u001b[66Gfrom\u001b[71GCodex's\u001b[79Greproductions,\u001b[94Gthen\u001b[99Ggate.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCooked for 13m 36s · done 12:20 am\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0021 ─\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m❯ Fix 1,2,3 now. Schedule 2 to be fixed the next time we need to amend jettison code. We will split the messages for\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  no\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;5H\u001b[?25h"]
