[0.053, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G- \u001b[1mSpl\u001b[9Gt the snapshot across messages in Jettison's network layer:\u001b[69G\u001b[22man\u001b[72Gengine\u001b[79Gchange,\u001b[87Greusable\u001b[96Gby\u001b[99Gany\u001b[103Ggame,\u001b[109Gwhich\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5GManifest then picks up by moving its pin. This is what I'd do.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mSmaller snapshots in Manifest:\u001b[22m send only what changed since the\u001b[69Glast\u001b[74Gone.\u001b[79GThat\u001b[84Gstays\u001b[90Gin\u001b[93GManifest\u001b[102Gbut\u001b[106Gis\u001b[109Ga\u001b[111Gbigger\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gprotocol change.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mRaise the packet limit:\u001b[29G\u001b[22monly\u001b[34Gbuys\u001b[39Gtime.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BFindings\u001b[12G1,\u001b[15G3\u001b[17Gand\u001b[21G4\u001b[23Gare\u001b[27Gclear\u001b[33Gfixes\u001b[39GI\u001b[41Gcan\u001b[45Gmake\u001b[50Gnow,\u001b[55Gwith\u001b[60Gtests\u001b[66Gfrom\u001b[71GCodex's\u001b[79Greproductions,\u001b[94Gthen\u001b[99Ggate.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCooked for 13m 36s · done 12:20 am\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mFix 1,2,3 now. Schedule 2 to be fixed the next time we need to amend jettison code. We will split the messages for \u001b[39m   \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mnow\u001b[7Gand look at manifest using delta frames later if the split\u001b[66Gisn't\u001b[72Genough.\u001b[39m                                       \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI'm\u001b[7Greading\u001b[15G\"1,\u001b[19G2,\u001b[22G3\"\u001b[25Gas\u001b[28Gthe\u001b[32Gthree\u001b[38GManifest\u001b[47Gfixes,\u001b[54Gwhich\u001b[60Gare\u001b[64Gfindings\u001b[73G1,\u001b[76G3\u001b[78Gand\u001b[82G4.\u001b[85GFinding\u001b[93G2,\u001b[96Gsplitting\u001b[106Gsnapshots\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gacross messages, gets\u001b[25Gscheduled for the next Jettison \u001b[59Gang\u001b[63G, with delta\u001b[76Gfr\u001b[79Gmes in Man\u001b[90Gfest a\u001b[97G the fallback if\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsplitting isn't enough. First, saving Cod\u001b[46G's reproductio\u001b[61Gs and rea\u001b[71Ging the code:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mReading\u001b[11G\u001b[1m2\u001b[13G\u001b[22mfiles,\u001b[20Glisting\u001b[28G\u001b[1m1\u001b[30G\u001b[22mdirectory,\u001b[41Grunning\u001b[49G\u001b[1m1\u001b[51G\u001b[22mshell\u001b[57Gcommand…\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ ls '/home/ivan/projects/manifest/build/reviews/stage-4'/round-3-salvage\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
