0Gtest,\u001b[106GCodex's\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Btwo-tote\u001b[15Gjob\u001b[19Gleaves\u001b[26Gcarrying\u001b[35Gone\u001b[39Gtote\u001b[44Gat\u001b[47Ghalf\u001b[52Gits\u001b[56Gcost\u001b[61Gand\u001b[65Gno\u001b[68Glonger\u001b[75Gblocks\u001b[82Gon\u001b[85Garrival.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3. \u001b[1mBidders check the delivery window.\u001b[22m A job \u001b[48Gow\u001b[51Gbids only when its estimated route fits the tender's delivery window.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   In Codex'\u001b[16G case, a one-\u001b[30Gay window ag\u001b[43Ginst a\u001b[50G7.6-day\u001b[58Groute,\u001b[65Git\u001b[68Gno\u001b[71Glonger\u001b[78Gbids.\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[1mFinding 2, oversized snapshots, is scheduled:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m-\u001b[5GJettison's\u001b[16Groadmap\u001b[24Gnow\u001b[28Glists\u001b[34Gsplitting\u001b[44Ga\u001b[46Gmessage\u001b[54Gacross\u001b[61Gpackets\u001b[69Gfor\u001b[73Gthe\u001b[77Gnext\u001b[82Gengine\u001b[89Gchange,\u001b[97Gwith\u001b[102Gdelta\u001b[108Gsnapshots\u001b[118Gin\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G  Manifest only if that isn't enough (Jettison \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m71e9a31\u001b[39m).\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- Until then, a remote client's view freezes whenever its snapshot passes 64 KiB, which the trading scenario reaches\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
