[0.042, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mFinding 2, oversized snapshots, is scheduled:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GJettison's\u001b[16Groadmap\u001b[24Gnow\u001b[28Glists\u001b[34Gsplitting\u001b[44Ga\u001b[46Gmessage\u001b[54Gacross\u001b[61Gpackets\u001b[69Gfor\u001b[73Gthe\u001b[77Gnext\u001b[82Gengine\u001b[89Gchange,\u001b[97Gwith\u001b[102Gdelta\u001b[108Gsnapshots\u001b[118Gin\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  Manifest only if that isn't enough (Jettison\u001b[50G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m71e9a31\u001b[39m).\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BUn\u001b[8Gil then, a remote clien\u001b[32G's view freezes when\u001b[53Gver it\u001b[61Gsnapshot passes\u001b[77G64 KiB, which the trading scenario reaches\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bwith about ten resting orders.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BMan\u001b[9Gfest's Stag\u001b[21G 4 plan, history and handoff record\u001b[57Gthe\u001b[62Game.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe two new policy\u001b[22Gtests pass n\u001b[35Gw,\u001b[38Gbut\u001b[42GI didn't rerun\u001b[60Gm on the\u001b[69Gold\u001b[73Gcode\u001b[78Gto\u001b[81Gsee\u001b[85Gthem\u001b[90Gfail.\u001b[96GThey\u001b[101Gfollow\u001b[108GCodex's\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Breproductions,\u001b[18Gwhich\u001b[24Gshowed\u001b[31Gthe\u001b[35Gold\u001b[39Gbehaviour.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GChurned for 36m 9s · done 1:02 am\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m※\u001b[3G\u001b[1mrecap: \u001b[22m\u001b[3mStage 4 is closed and cross-reviewed, and round 3's three Manifest fixes are committed and pass the full gate. \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BNext, push both repos when you're ready, then start R01, Stage 5's save inventory. (turn off recaps in /config)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255msafe to clear?\u001b[39m                                                                                     