[0.048, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe \u001b[8Gwo new policy tests\u001b[28Gpa\u001b[31Gs now, but I\u001b[44Gdidn't r\u001b[53Grun them on the\u001b[69Gold\u001b[73Gcode to s\u001b[83Ge th\u001b[88Gm f\u001b[92Gil. They fol\u001b[105Gow\u001b[108GCodex's\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Breproductions, which showed \u001b[32Gh\u001b[34G \u001b[36Gld behaviour.\u001b[50G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GChurned for 36m 9s · done 1:02 am\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m※\u001b[3G\u001b[1mrecap: \u001b[22m\u001b[3mStage 4 is closed and cross-reviewed, and round 3's three Manifest fixes are committed and pass the full gate. \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BNext, push both repos when you're ready, then start R01, Stage 5's save inventory. (turn off recaps in /config)\u001b[23m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255msafe to clear?\u001b[39m                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mYes, it's safe to clear. Both trees are clean with everything committed. Each repo is one commit ahead of \u001b[38;2;177;185;249morigin\u001b[116G\u001b[39mand\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bnot\u001b[7Gpushed:\u001b[15GManifest\u001b[24G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249me1def0f\u001b[32G\u001b[39m(the\u001b[37Ground\u001b[43G3\u001b[45Gfixes)\u001b[52Gand\u001b[56GJettison\u001b[65G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m71e9a31\u001b[73G\u001b[39m(the\u001b[78Groadmap\u001b[86Gentry\u001b[92Gfor\u001b[96Gsplitting\u001b[106Gmessages).\u001b[117GPush\r\u001b[1B  first if you want them on GitHub.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3GThe next session starts from\u001b[32GManifest's\u001b[43G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249msession-handoff.md\u001b[39m,\u001b[63Gwhich\u001b[69Gsays\u001b[74GR01\u001b[78Gis\u001b[81Gnext.\u001b[87GThe\u001b[91Goversized-snapshot\u001b[110Gfix\u001b[114Gis\u001b[117Gon\r\u001b[1B  Jettison's roadmap, so nothing from this session would be\u001b[61Glost.\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
