[0.223, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, read \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI fixed the three Manifest findings from rou\u001b[48Gd 3, and the\u001b[61Gfull\u001b[66Ggate passed on Manifes\u001b[89G \u001b[38;2;177;185;249me1def0f\u001b[39m: all four presets, the\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsanitise\u001b[12G one\u001b[17Gincluded, ti\u001b[30Gy clean, no p\u001b[45Gned hash moved. N\u001b[63Gither rep\u001b[73G is pushed.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B1. \u001b[1mNetwork\u001b[14Gsnap\u001b[19Ghots\u001b[24Gare now complete\u001b[22m (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mProtocol.cpp\u001b[39m).\u001b[57GA\u001b[59Gremote\u001b[66Gclient's\u001b[75Gsnapshot\u001b[84Gnow\u001b[88Gincludes\u001b[97Gits\u001b[101Gships'\u001b[108Gpolicies\u001b[117Gand\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G jobs, it\u001b[16Gc\u001b[18Gmpany's sealed bids and the\u001b[46Gpo\u001b[49Gted tender\u001b[60G. A n\u001b[66Gw remote test sends a snapshot\u001b[97Gholding all of t\u001b[114Gem over\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B the ne\u001b[13Gw\u001b[15Grk format and ge\u001b[32Gs it back unchanged.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2. \u001b[1mRefuelling from a pellet cargo updates the job.\u001b[22m If\u001b[57Gthe\u001b[61Gmagazine\u001b[70Gis r\u001b[75Gfilled from totes the job is \u001b[105Garry\u001b[110Gng to s\u001b[118Gll,\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B those to\u001b[15Ges leave the\u001b[28Gjob's lot\u001b[38Galong\u001b[44Gwith\u001b[49Gtheir\u001b[55Gshare\u001b[61Gof\u001b[64Gits\u001b[68Gcost,\u001b[74Gspare\u001b[80Gpellets\u001b[88Gfirst.\u001b[95GTo\u001b[98Gshare\u001b[104Gthe\u001b[108Grule\u001b[113Gwith\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G the seizure, I moved it\u001b[30Gfrom the policy code into World \u001b[63Gs \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mWorld::LeaveLot\u001b[39m.\u001b[82GIn\u001b[85Gthe\u001b[89Gnew\u001b[93Gpolicy\u001b[100Gtest,\u001b[106GCodex's\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Btwo-tote\u001b[15Gjob\u001b[19Gleaves\u001b[26Gcarrying\u001b[35Gone\u001b[39Gtote\u001b[44Gat\u001b[47Ghalf\u001b[52Gits\u001b[56Gcost\u001b[61Gand\u001b[65Gno\u001b[68Glonger\u001b[75Gblocks\u001b[82Gon\u001b[85Garrival.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3. \u001b[1mBidders check the delivery window.\u001b[22m A job \u001b[48Gow\u001b[51Gbids only when its estimated route fits the tender's delivery window.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   In Codex'\u001b[16G case, a one-\u001b[30Gay window ag\u001b[43Ginst a\u001b[50G7.6-day\u001b[58Groute,\u001b[65Git\u001b[68Gno\u001b[71Glonger\u001b[78Gbids.\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[1mFinding 2, oversized snapshots, is scheduled:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m-\u001b[5GJettison's\u001b[16Groadmap\u001b[24Gnow\u001b[28Glists\u001b[34Gsplitting\u001b[44Ga\u001b[46Gmessage\u001b[54Gacross\u001b[61Gpackets\u001b[69Gfor\u001b[73Gthe\u001b[77Gnext\u001b[82Gengine\u001b[89Gchange,\u001b[97Gwith\u001b[102Gdelta\u001b[108Gsnapshots\u001b[118Gin\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G  Manifest only if that isn't enough (Jettison \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m71e9a31\u001b[39m).\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- Until then, a remote client's view freezes\u001b[76G 64 KiB, which the trading scenario reaches\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
