ts, is scheduled:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- Jettison's roadmap now lists splitting a message\u001b[54Gacross\u001b[61Gpackets\u001b[69Gfor\u001b[73Gthe\u001b[77Gnext\u001b[82Gengine\u001b[89Gchange,\u001b[97Gwith\u001b[102Gdelta\u001b[108Gsnapshots\u001b[118Gin\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5GManifest only if that isn'\u001b[32G enough (Jettison \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m71e9a31\u001b[39m).\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GUnt\u001b[9Gl then, a\u001b[19Gremote clien\u001b[32G's view\u001b[40Gfr\u001b[43Geze\u001b[47G whenever its\u001b[61Gsnapshot\u001b[70Gpasses\u001b[77G64\u001b[80GKiB,\u001b[85Gwhich\u001b[91Gthe\u001b[95Gtrading\u001b[103Gscenario\u001b[112Greaches\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gwi\u001b[8Gh about ten res\u001b[24Ging order\u001b[34G.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GManifest's\u001b[16GStage 4 plan, history\u001b[38Gand\u001b[42Ghandoff\u001b[50Grecord\u001b[57Gthe\u001b[61Gsame.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe\u001b[7Gtwo\u001b[11Gnew\u001b[15Gpolicy\u001b[22Gtests\u001b[28Gpass\u001b[33Gnow,\u001b[38Gbut\u001b[42GI\u001b[44Gdidn't\u001b[51Grerun\u001b[57Gthem\u001b[62Gon\u001b[65Gthe\u001b[69Gold\u001b[73Gcode\u001b[78Gto\u001b[81Gsee\u001b[85Gthem\u001b[90Gfail.\u001b[96GThey\u001b[101Gfollow\u001b[108GCodex's\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Breproductions, which \u001b[25Ghowed the old behaviou\u001b[75G\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
