[0.080, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G \u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mServer::Publish\u001b[39m). Jettison's network \u001b[43Gerver then skips\u001b[60Ga\u001b[62Gy client whos\u001b[76G last snapshot is less than \u001b[38;2;177;185;249msnapshotInterval\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[39mold. That defaults to 100 m\u001b[34G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mjettison/net/Server.h:39\u001b[39m), and Ma\u001b[69Gifest doesn't override it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mWhat each one costs:\u001b[22m every \u001b[33Gnapshot is that player's full filtered view, with\u001b[83Gno deltas. In\u001b[97Gthe\u001b[101Gtrading\u001b[109Gscenario\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gthat is about 63.5 KB, so roughly 635 KB/s,\u001b[49Gor about\u001b[58G5 Mbit/s, p\u001b[70Gr\u001b[72Gclient. It\u001b[83Gg\u001b[85Ges on the unreliable chann\u001b[112Gl, where\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Ba newer\u001b[13Gsnapshot replaces\u001b[31Gone still in flight.\u001b[52G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mServer-side work:\u001b[22m the s\u001b[29Grver also runs\u001b[44G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mQuery::Observe\u001b[59G\u001b[39mand\u001b[63Gserialises\u001b[74Gthe\u001b[78Gresult\u001b[85Gfor\u001b[89Gevery\u001b[95Gclient\u001b[102Gat\u001b[105Gthat\u001b[110Grate.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThat\u001b[8Gis\u001b[11Ga\u001b[13Glot\u001b[17Gfor\u001b[21Ga\u001b[23Ggame\u001b[28Gwhere\u001b[34Gthe\u001b[38Gsimulation's\u001b[51Geconomy\u001b[59Gturns\u001b[65Gonce\u001b[70Ga\u001b[72Gsimulated\u001b[82Ghour\u001b[87Gand\u001b[91Gtravel\u001b[98Gtakes\u001b[104Gminutes\u001b[112Gto\u001b[115Gdays.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BIf you w\u001b[12Gnt, a che\u001b[22Gp first st\u001b[33Gp b\u001b[37Gfore spl\u001b[46Gtting messages or adding deltas is to set \u001b[38;2;177;185;249msnapshotInterval\u001b[39m to 1 \u001b[111G, \u001b[114Gr send\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bonl\u001b[7G when \u001b[14Ghe cli\u001b[21Gnt's view has\u001b[35Gchang\u001b[41Gd. E\u001b[47Gher would cut\u001b[61Gthe load abou\u001b[75G tenfold, though neither fixes the\u001b[110G64\u001b[113GKiB\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Blimit.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GBrewed for 31s · done 1:10 am\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mset snapshotInterval to 1 second\u001b[39m                                                                                      \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning\u001b[11Gcd\u001b[14G'/home/ivan/projects/manifest'\u001b[45G&&\u001b[48Gcmake\u001b[54G--buil…\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ cd '/home/ivan/projects/manifest' && cmake --build --preset clang-debug 2>&1 | rg -n ' error: |warning: ' | head \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(3s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
